Info-tier skip-comma style (both off by default): a spaced skip `, ,`
inside an argument list or argument array fires
diag.spaced_skip_commas; skipped slots that end a call's argument list
fire diag.trailing_skip_commas, one per call over the whole run. A spaced
run that also ends the list is reported only as trailing (one finding
per cause).
Suspected issue: #328 — DoProc("Helper", {1},,) also fires builtin_excess_arguments (surplus 1 argument "never evaluated") in the default profile, while trailing_skip_commas' catalog says `Foo(a,,)` "is exactly `Foo(a)`", which has no surplus: one cause, two findings with contradictory explanations.
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE Skips;
	:DECLARE vOut;
	vOut := DoProc("Helper", {1, , 3});
	vOut := LSearch("SELECT name FROM lots WHERE id = ?", "", , {7});
	vOut := DoProc("Helper", {1},,);
	vOut := SubStr("abcdef", 2, , );
	:RETURN vOut;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:PROCEDURE Skips;
	:DECLARE vOut;
	vOut := DoProc("Helper", {1,, 3});
	vOut := LSearch("SELECT name FROM lots WHERE id = ?", "",, {7});
	vOut := DoProc("Helper", {1},,);
	vOut := SubStr("abcdef", 2,,);
	:RETURN vOut;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
5:10-5:16 warning builtin_excess_arguments: 'DoProc' accepts at most 2 argument(s) - the compiler silently drops the surplus 1 argument (never evaluated)
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
3:29-3:32 info spaced_skip_commas: Spaced skip-commas - write the skip form with adjacent commas (',,') so the skipped argument reads as deliberate
4:58-4:61 info spaced_skip_commas: Spaced skip-commas - write the skip form with adjacent commas (',,') so the skipped argument reads as deliberate
5:10-5:16 warning builtin_excess_arguments: 'DoProc' accepts at most 2 argument(s) - the compiler silently drops the surplus 1 argument (never evaluated)
5:30-5:32 info trailing_skip_commas: Trailing skipped arguments before ')' are unnecessary - the runtime pads missing trailing arguments with NIL; omit them
6:28-6:31 info trailing_skip_commas: Trailing skipped arguments before ')' are unnecessary - the runtime pads missing trailing arguments with NIL; omit them
